# Learned modules of the MAST pipeline: <bytes> <sha256> <path under the work directory>.
# The inverse profiles (p7a, p7c, p7a_tsw05, p7li) have no learned weight file (the l_i model of p7li is the json in ch2/constants/p7li).
# The syn_* profiles train their network during the run on synthetic equilibria driven by the input columns of the shots being
# predicted (RUN_MODELS in ch2/pipelines/syn_net.inc; sha256 in the run's record.json). For a Final submission made with a syn_*
# profile, the network of that run is published with the weights and listed here (tools/publish_model.py; RUNBOOK_FINAL.md step B.7);
# SYN_MODEL_FILE=<that file> then reproduces the predictions without retraining.
# Profiles int_b50c1nx / int_b50gld: the DIII-D-trained map corrector (LightGBM, 9 outputs; ch2/train_corr_b50.sh; DIII-D TRAIN labels only).
